    <header class="record-toolbar"><div><span class="eyebrow green">AGRICULTURE MANAGEMENT</span><h2>Agricultural Assistance & Subsidy — Applications</h2><p class="muted">Assistance programs, farmer applications, beneficiary validation, approvals, and distribution records.</p></div></header>
